    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This pirate once ruled the South Sea of Giran along with Pirate King Zaken. Calling himself Zaken's only rival, he raided the Pirate King's headquarters after hearing the news that Zaken was missing. Instead of treasure, he and his mean were struck down by Zaken's curse. Now an undead, his sole aim is to take his revenge on Zaken someday. Undead Lv. 1 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Undead. HP Recovery +10% Received P. Crit. Rate -5 Received Critical Damage -5% Received M. Crit. Damage -5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +3% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Holy -10% Holy Vulnerability Lv. 2 Vulnerable to Divinity attack. Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dagger/Rapier Resistance Lv. 3 Resistant to Dagger/Rapier attacks. Blunt Weapon Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Blunt Weapons. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
